repository-code: "https://github.com/BIC-MNI/libminc"
abstract: >-
  libminc is the core library and API of the MINC toolkit. MINC is a medical
  image file format built on HDF5 (MINC 2) and NetCDF (MINC 1), with
  programming interfaces for low-level data access and for high-level volume
  manipulation (Volume IO).
